             _)` call outside the DataProp / AriaProp / SvgProp helper
             modules. Mirrors the Support/SubjectWildcardAnalyzer.fs
             text-scanner pattern. -->
        <Compile Include="InProcess\DomAttrCustomAuditTests.fs" />
