             `SurfaceRequirementRegistry.merge` semantics
             (longest-prefix-wins, module exact wins, case
             normalisation), and the four `Visibility` smart
             constructors. -->
        <Compile Include="InProcess\ModuleSurfaceRequirementTests.fs" />
        <!-- Phase 66 Stream B.4 — pins the SDK built-in per-route
             surface-requirement overrides folded into the
             `SurfaceRequirementRegistry` by `fromServerConfig`.
             Today: the five `TeamApi` team-CRUD mutating endpoints
             declared `teamScoped` per design §3.3's "Per-endpoint
             overrides" caveat on the `PlatformApi` row. -->
        <Compile Include="InProcess\BuiltInModuleSurfaceTests.fs" />
        <!-- Phase 66 Stream B.8 — client identity flow keyed on
             SubjectKind. Pins the textual shape of UserSession.configure
             (now takes SubjectKind), AuthUIProvider.gate (now takes
