             CMP-event handling is Fable-only and exercised in the
             consumer's browser tests. Precedent: AuthProviders/OidcClient
             above ships under the same pattern (client-tier project
             referenced into Tests for the .NET-reachable subset). -->
        <ProjectReference Include="..\ToolUp.Platform.Client\ToolUp.Platform.Client.fsproj" />
        <!-- Phase 57 follow-up — Build package reference brings in
             `ToolUp.Platform.Prerender.serialiseRoutes` /
             `nodeScript` / `PrerenderTargetOptions.defaults` for the
             determinism tests. The Build package is .NET-only (no
             Fable surface), so .NET tests can drive its pure helpers
             directly without an interop boundary. -->
        <ProjectReference Include="..\ToolUp.Platform.Build\ToolUp.Platform.Build.fsproj" />
